OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies' 'turmoil' as fire
OL,4,Adevastation sinks in
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies who lost their homes in a
OL,7,Fdevastating fire have said they are "in
OL,8,Fturmoil" while they absorb the extent
OL,9,Fof the damage and adapt to new living
OL,10,Farrangements.
OL,12,FNineteen homes around Three Springs
OL,13,FRoad in Pershore, Worcestershire, were
OL,14,Faffected by the blaze on 13 August, as
OL,15,Fseveral fires swept through areas of
OL,16,Fthe West Midlands on the same day.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
