OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies' 'turmoil' as fire
OL,4,Adevastation sinks in
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Mike Ruff said he, his partner
OL,7,Fand three children were living in his
OL,8,Fbrother's living room, while neighbour
OL,9,FRoy Candlin and his wife and two
OL,10,Fchildren were using an Airbnb. Both
OL,11,Ffamilies may have to wait up to 18
OL,12,Fmonths before they can return home.
OL,14,F"You wake up every day and you actually
OL,15,Fcan't believe that it's happened to
OL,16,Fyou," Ruff said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
